# REQUIRES: python-api
# Persistent simulations on the CPU (D196), scenario npt of
# Inputs/python_segments.py.
# NPT runs of 1 + 7 + 13 steps, and of 1 x 5 + 3 x 2 + 10, against
# uninterrupted ones, equal to the bit in double and mixed precision, cell
# included (D[resident-buffers]), and the phase of the coupling across their
# boundaries.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_segments.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir %t npt | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NPT VelocityVerlet Double: parts of 1+7+13 and of 1x5+3x2+10 equal 21 steps in one part to the bit
# CHECK: NPT VelocityVerlet Mixed: parts of 1+7+13 and of 1x5+3x2+10 equal 21 steps in one part to the bit
# CHECK: NPT: the coupling moves the velocities
# CHECK: segments npt passed
